<title>NEW ZEALAND: CRICKET-ENGLAND 123 FOR ONE VS NZ AT CLOSE.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-ENGLAND 123 FOR ONE VS NZ AT CLOSE.</headline>
<dateline>AUCKLAND 1997-01-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>England, chasing a New Zealand first innings total of 390, were 123 for one after bad light stopped play an hour before the close in the second day of the first test match on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scores</p>
<p>New Zealand - first innings 390 (B.Pocock 70, S.Fleming 129, C.Cairns 67; D.Gough four for 91)</p>
<p>England - A.Stewart not out 67.</p>
